"P3284860340" "Strange parts"
// DetailString :
"P3024158339" "You found these parts in a Clockwork nest, but they're clearly not from any Clockwork construct. The robots defended them with vigor, so the parts must mean something to them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WorkerConversation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2758303729" "The FEMA worker's story"
// DetailString :
"P3904955735" "One of the FEMA workers you rescued told you:<br><br>'That Horror dude kept going on and on about how he was wantin' the plans to the city dam up in Faultline. I ain't got no ideas why they would want that!'"

