// IntroString :
"P3750106096" "Thank you for all your hard work. Up for another test? You've really proven yourself, and I think I can give you a tougher mission. I have examined the Clockwork pieces at DATA and SERAPH, and I've made some interesting discoveries. But I need to know more. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you find me a piece of Clockwork that is still functioning?</A> No one else has been able to recover a piece like that."
// AcceptString :
"P3041921443" "Find a piece of Clockwork that is still functioning"
// SendOffString :
"P2209979516" "I scanned the area, and I found an abandoned warehouse that's infested with Clockwork."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P643396296" "Defeat all Clockwork in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1988043478" "Show me you can handle these Clockwork. I want to know I can count on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2097150154" "The grinding of Clockwork gears is almost deafening. It seems you have stumbled onto a major operation."

