"P1912542592" "I must say, I'm impressed with how you've handled the work I've given you. In fact, I think you're ready for another challenge! States just radioed with a crisis. The Circle of Thorns are attacking the Federal Emergency Management Agency in Skyway City. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero to save the FEMA workers.</A> Can you help us?"
// AcceptString :
"P991063893" "Save the FEMA workers"
// SendOffString :
"P3481658487" "Great. I hear the leader of these mystics is named Rollister. Your priority is to take him out of commission."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1977435114" "Defeat Rollister and his cadre"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1215540738" "Hold on, States. Why are you guys still here? You need to rescue those workers right now! Ok, States, repeat your last message. I was interrupted."

