// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1297716778" "Well, I analyzed that chemical you found in the Vahzilok nest. It turns out it's a complex bonded molecular compound with twisted valences. Very high tech stuff. I was intrigued by their ability to... oh, sorry. Ok, here's some information you can use now. One of the chemicals in the compound was polyfluidic morscarpium. Pretty specialized. Only two distributors in the area even make it. I checked their shipments for the past couple weeks, and traced one to a company in Skyway that doesn't exist. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you check out the fake company?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P798549707" "Check out the fake company"
// SendOffString :
"P2850218648" "The name on the lease is Dr. Morben. I'd like you to arrest him, if you can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1917362989" "Stop Dr. Morben and his minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1699860709" "You should be checking out that Vahzilok operation."

