// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2295690000" "I just did a quick scan with my ground penetrating radar. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to check out a possible Circle of Thorns hideout.</A> We've got to find out whether the Circle realizes that the ritual they plan to perform at the dam may be interrupted by the Clockwork and the Vahzilok."
// AcceptString :
"P2871929493" "Check out possible Circle of Thorns hideout"
// SendOffString :
"P3948741363" "I'll be monitoring you via radio throughout the mission."

